\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Spearman $\rho = 1.0$ between token novelty and Cohen's $d$, indicating that CF sensitivity tracks lexical/positional distance rather than semantic content. Trajectory-level $d$ inflates token-level $d$ by $\sim $4$\times $ via temporal autocorrelation.}}{8}{table.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
